# SPU research: keep the primary captures and the disassembly text, not the
# regenerable intermediates. lsdump.txt is five lines of python from the .bin,
# and spu-hot-window-image.bin is just a copy of the local store the harness
# was handed.
_research/spurs/*.lsdump.txt
_research/spurs/*/spu-hot-window-image.bin
_research/spurs/*/ghidra-headless.log
